{
 "id": "halfmoon",
 "title": "OohNah: Halfmoon",
 "heading": "Which one is Halfmoon?",
 "hint": "Swipe right if this could be the brand, left if not. After 12 cards the deck starts remixing what you liked. Buttons and arrow keys work too.",
 "brief": "Halfmoon is a made-up neighbourhood coffee roaster. Its look will live on a shop poster, on the bags, on the menu board and in social posts, so every card shows one look on one of those four surfaces instead of on an abstract swatch.",
 "fonts": "https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Anton&family=Bangers&family=UnifrakturMaguntia&family=IM+Fell+English:ital@0;1&family=Permanent+Marker&family=Archivo+Black&family=Bagel+Fat+One&family=Bricolage+Grotesque:opsz,wght@12..96,400;12..96,800&family=Caveat+Brush&family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,500;1,500&family=Fraunces:opsz,wght@9..144,800&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;600&family=Instrument+Serif:ital@0;1&family=Major+Mono+Display&family=Space+Mono:wght@700&family=Press+Start+2P&family=Rubik+Mono+One&family=Syne:wght@800&family=Unbounded:wght@400;800&family=Inter+Tight:wght@400;600&family=Work+Sans:wght@400;600&display=swap",
 "total": 30,
